&lt;b&gt;Corps &#224; corps&lt;/b&gt; 2 griffes +18 (2d4+8 et &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;&#201;treinte-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;&#201;treinte&quot;&gt;&#233;treinte&lt;/a&gt;), morsure +18 (2d6+8/19-20 et &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;&#201;treinte-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;&#201;treinte&quot;&gt;&#233;treinte&lt;/a&gt;)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
